  "answer": "Corvina Airways does not cover the cost of a taxi to a different airport for passengers whose flights are cancelled. However, you may be eligible for a full refund or rebooking on the next available Corvina flight, depending on the circumstances of the cancellation. While waiting for an alternative flight, you will receive care as described in S06, which may include assistance with transportation, but not necessarily a taxi. Please check with our customer service for more details on your specific situation.",
